{"author":{"id":"1e0a6ff3e01313072cf7b3803c158c22d01a37717237fe198e814e781752b172"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1785296495,"nonce":"J49CC7lJTepDvEPvv9VL5yw8XOI=","title":"b4 review tui: trailer menu deletes unmanaged trailers from reply buffer","message":"Reported by Matthieu Baerts in https://lore.kernel.org/tools/b2c44799-85a9-4576-9aae-b43eb1092315@kernel.org/\n\nWith a hand-edited reply buffer present, opening the trailer menu and toggling a checkbox (e.g. adding Reviewed-by) silently deletes any trailer-looking line the maintainer typed into the buffer that is not one of the menu's four options. In the report, a hand-written 'Fixes:' line disappeared from the reply, leaving two blank lines around where it used to be.","files":null}]}